YerFORhPeFZvqL61zvdj_J121VSuhQdV-94F3xZQiufS7QXikHDuTaWEDoOA4NLa-yiwnRK5u862XqnAjOP4pbrOgDEt1dZ-JJI5b3JN4AuieHu6MCYlaAlk7xms5UgLO0HigEnarMFDBma_\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Deciding when to read skill files**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_AN46a3X1Ubc6sAqFE0aZiIK1|fc_01457dd4b156aa800169a6de904fc48191b7b0d323ac83f994","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":250,"output":186,"cacheRead":12416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12852,"cost":{"input":0.0004375,"output":0.002604,"cacheRead":0.0021728,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0052143}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772543635712}}
{"type":"message","id":"bf325bf6","parentId":"2fe70686","timestamp":"2026-03-03T13:13:59.936Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_AN46a3X1Ubc6sAqFE0aZiIK1|fc_01457dd4b156aa800169a6de904fc48191b7b0d323ac83f994","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web page unit test books from detailed design Excel files, embedded images/OCR text, LWC/Apex source code, and a user-provided Excel template. Use when user asks to read design docs, extract field/API/check rules, parse code branches and data bindings, generate test cases, and fill a unit test book template (.xlsx).\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book Generator\n\nBuild and run a deterministic pipeline for unit test book generation.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Parse design Excel into `design_rules.json`.\n2. Parse LWC/Apex code into `code_rules.json`.\n3. Merge rules and generate markdown spec + normalized case JSON.\n4. Fill the user template workbook and export final test book.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Design workbook (`.xlsx`) with field definitions, API names, check notes, optional screenshots.\n- Code folder or zip with LWC/Apex files.\n- Unit test template workbook (`.xlsx`).\n\n## Commands\n\nRun from this skill directory.\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/parse_design_excel.py --input <design.xlsx> --out design_rules.json --ocr-lang jpn+eng\npython scripts/extract_code_rules.py --src <code_dir_or_zip> --out code_rules.json\npython scripts/generate_high_precision.py --design design_rules.json --code code_rules.json --out-md UnitTestSpec_HighPrecision.md --out-cases cases.json\npython scripts/export_to_excel.py --template <template.xlsx> --cases cases.json --out 単体試験書_WF001.xlsx\n```\n\nOr run one-shot:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir out\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- OCR is optional: install Tesseract and pass `--ocr-lang`.\n- If template headers are unknown, script performs best-effort column mapping by keyword.\n- Keep all output artifacts in one run directory for traceability.\n\n## Output Artifacts\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json`\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec_HighPrecision.md`\n- `単体試験書_*.xlsx`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772543639934}}
